Package: fastumi-tools-resources
Version: @CATALOG_VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: FastUMI Team <yding25@binghamton.edu>
Depends: fastumi-tools (>= @MINIMUM_TOOLS_VERSION@)
Homepage: https://github.com/KM-Data-Pipeline/FastUMI_Tools
Description: XVSDK and firmware resources for FastUMI Tools
 Versioned Gen 1 and Gen 2 XVSDK packages plus Gen 1 camera firmware artifacts
 for Ubuntu 20.04 Focal amd64. Gen 2 firmware remains Windows-only. Files are
 verified against the FastUMI catalog before installation or flashing.
